## 🗺️ Roadmap

- [ ] Database integration for persistent messages
- [ ] User authentication and authorization
- [ ] Message history
- [ ] Improved mobile responsiveness
- [ ] File and media sharing
- [ ] Permanent cloud deployment

## ⚠️ Current Limitations

NexusChat is a development project. Messages are not persistently stored in a database, and full user authentication is not currently implemented. Do not use it for sensitive communications.

